# Code Review Standards

When editing or reviewing pull requests, strictly apply the guidelines detailed in the Code Review Checklist skill:

See the full checklist in [code-review-checklist.md](file:///Users/tobbiesng/Code/beer-voter/docs/skills/code-review-checklist.md).

## Critical Guidelines
1. **Strict Types**: Reject any use of `any` types or lint-bypassing comments.
2. **Vietnamese Comments**: All code comments and descriptions must be written in Vietnamese.
3. **No CSS Frameworks**: Ensure no Tailwind, CSS modules, or inline styling is introduced.
4. **Validation Check**: Run formatting and type-checking scripts to verify changes.
